 is more than meets the eye. With three different endings and an unlockable bonus mode, and mutually exclusive achievements, prepare to explore the world of Deodar more than once. Allow yourself to get lost in its ambient soundscapes and pixel art charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a retro-inspired game. This means that, like the games of old, the player is expected to explore and figure things out. This adds in a layer of difficulty which is not always present in modern games.</p>","developers":["GilesSoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708850/296fab9bce84f54a00c0c033ab9327dfe3251b31/header.jpg?t=1765592218","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2025, Lance Giles, All rights reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any Distro from 2016 onwards<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86_64 CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with full OpenGL 3.3 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 210 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any distro from 2020 onwards<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86_64 CPU with SSE4.2 instructions, with 4 physical cores or more<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated graphics with full OpenGL 4.6 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 210 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3708850/85239992/2c874398690e5cb34cb39eb050745058